  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Lifetime",
      "items": [
        "AddPdfGenerator is idempotent: only the first call's options build the singleton PdfGenerator.",
        "PdfGenerator launches one Chromium instance on first use and relaunches it only if it disconnects.",
        "A Chromium download (BrowserFetcher) runs once, serialized across concurrent first calls."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Not pictured",
      "items": [
        "ThemeService, TableOfContentsCreator and ModuleService exist in the package but are never constructed by PdfGenerator.",
        "There is no page or browser pool: every conversion opens and closes its own page."
      ]
    }
  ]
